heretic-structure-carver-list = The following runes can be carved:

heretic-structure-carver-already = already carving!

heretic-structure-carver-too-close = to close to another carving!

heretic-structure-carver-too-many = too many carvings!

heretic-structure-carver-interrupted = interrupted!

heretic-structure-carver-dispelled = carving dispelled

heretic-structure-carver-tip-alert = A nearly invisible rune that, when stepped on, alerts the carver who triggered it and where.

heretic-structure-carver-tip-tentacle = When stepped on, causes heavy damage leg damage and stuns the victim for 5 seconds. Has 1 charge.

heretic-structure-carver-tip-mad = When stepped on, causes heavy stamina damage, blindness, and a variety of ailments to the victim. Has 2 charges.

heretic-structure-lock-tear-vanish = The rip in space spasms and disappears!

heretic-structure-lock-tear-examine = You can use this to enter the world as a foul monster.

heretic-structure-crucible-refill = You can refill an eldritch flask with this

heretic-structure-crucible-list = The following potions can be brewed:

heretic-structure-crucible-flask-full = flask is full!

heretic-structure-crucible-refilled = refilled flask

heretic-structure-crucible-invalid-organ = invalid organ!

heretic-structure-crucible-in-use = in use!

heretic-structure-crucible-potion-created = potion created

heretic-structure-crucible-full = crucible full!

heretic-structure-potion-tip-soul = Allows you to walk through walls. After expiring, you are teleported to your original location. Lasts 40 seconds.

heretic-structure-potion-cooldown = on cooldown!

heretic-structure-potion-tip-duskndawn = Allows you to see through walls and objects. Lasts 90 seconds.

heretic-structure-carver-total = <b>{ $count } / { $max }</b> total carvings have been drawn.

heretic-structure-carver-carving = carving { $name }...

heretic-structure-carver-carved = { $name } carved

heretic-structure-carver-alert = { $victim } has stepped foot on the alert rune in { $area }!

heretic-structure-crucible-break = { $item } falls apart with a thud!

heretic-structure-crucible-break-spill = { $item } falls apart with a thud, spilling shining extract everywhere!

heretic-structure-crucible-requires = { $item } requires <b>{ $count }</b> more { $count ->
    [one] organ
   *[other] organs
 } or { $count ->
    [one] bodypart
   *[other] bodyparts
 }.

heretic-structure-crucible-ready = { $item } is bubbling to the brim with viscous liquid, and is ready to use.

heretic-structure-crucible-anchor-unanchor = You can <b>unanchor and move</b> { $item } with a <b>Codex Cicatrix</b> or <b>Mansus Grasp</b>.

heretic-structure-crucible-anchor-place = You can <b>anchor in place</b> { $item } with a <b>Codex Cicatrix</b> or <b>Mansus Grasp</b>.

heretic-structure-crucible-stability = It's at <b>{ $percent }%</b> stability.

heretic-structure-crucible-anchored = anchored

heretic-structure-crucible-unanchored = unanchored

heretic-structure-crucible-not-full = not full enough!

heretic-structure-crucible-not-organic = not organic!

heretic-structure-crucible-brewed = { $item }'s shining liquid drains into a flask, creating a { $potion }!

heretic-structure-crucible-grabs = { $item } grabs your { $zone }!

heretic-structure-crucible-devours = { $item } devours { $consumed } and fills itself with a little bit of liquid!

heretic-structure-crucible-fed = crubile fed ({ $mass } / { $max })

heretic-structure-potion-down = You down some of the liquid from { $item }. The taste causes you to retch, and the glass vanishes.

heretic-structure-potion-drink = You drink the viscous liquid from { $item }, causing the glass to dematerialize.

heretic-structure-potion-tip-wounded = Causes all wounds you are experiencing to begin to heal you. Fractures, sprains, cuts, and punctures will heal bruises, and flesh damage will heal burns. The more severe the wounds, the stronger the healing. Additionally, prevents slowdown from damage. Lasts 60 seconds.{ " " }
